              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Anyoika kereka araito nuipotu kodumut kapaarasia kaŋun, kakiro kaŋun nukisurumito kwana ileic? Naarai awasia naka akiro kaŋun ŋes atwanare. ",
