              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye kwana kidaut aosikinio anyoun kadiakar iraut ibulesin luka Edeke, idumut araito nueyaunete alaunit, awasiakec da ŋes aijar naka ikar kere. ",
          "type": "text",
